  "qualification": "Final 0.67 identity renewal using the exact retained baseline capture, separately bound original and current generators, and fresh candidate graphs. Functional preparation against exact Site 107 published source 4ff7bf45286a8a19d34401988adca587253ae41e. Every role graph is reconstructed and validated from its own frozen Kernel/store; all fragment identities and changed roots are checked. Binding, SelectedRigid, Motif and OrderedRecruitment exist in both roles; only BranchRouting is added. Motif and BranchRouting use their actual registered wrappers, and Recruitment passive calls use its real acquisition instance. Exact work shapes exclude only independently bound implementation identity and declared structural counts. All raw common node values and common delta identities/causes/order are compared; differences remain without removing node.value or replacing clocks. Only exact reasoning:trace created scalar/float64 leaves with unmodified source clock code and actual service.handle wall-clock bounds receive clock attribution. Other private differences remain unqualified. State presence, negative proposals, graph nodes, acquiredRecords and acquiredTransitions do not establish successful BranchRouting acquisition, positive game contribution or official success. The separate cold synthetic contribution corpus and official game results retain their own scopes. This artifact grants no official timing readiness, full source/caller parity or publication."
}
